# The Argon review tooling under tools/ai_review is source code and must stay
# tracked. The blanket tools/ rule above would silently ignore it; these
# entries re-open only that folder and keep everything else under tools/ out
# of version control.
#
# tools/* ignores every direct child of tools/, so a new local binary or
# download folder cannot be committed by accident. !tools/ai_review/ then
# re-opens exactly the one folder that holds source code. The earlier
# !tools/ + re-ignore pair had the opposite effect: it re-opened all of tools/
# and only re-closed the two folders that happened to exist at the time.
!tools/
tools/*
!tools/ai_review/
